---
const pillars = [
  ['Precision', 'Concepts built to be built, from Revit to IFC.'],
  ['Vision', 'Reading the brief and giving it one clear idea.'],
  ['Scale', 'National projects and corporate headquarters.'],
  ['Craft', 'Material, light and the detail that holds it.'],
];
const cv = [
  ['2024 – now', 'Architect & Interior Designer, Concept Design · ZFP'],
  ['2020 – 2024', 'Architect & Interior Designer, Concept Design · Cosmos Studio'],
  ['2014 – 2019', 'B.Sc. Architectural Engineering · Future University in Egypt'],
];
---
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <span class="label eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2>Aya Hassan</h2>
      <blockquote>A concept is only useful once someone believes in it.</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Aya is an architect and interior designer working in concept design. She joined ZFP (Zuhair Fayez Partnership) in 2024, where she shapes headquarters interiors for SABIC and STC in Riyadh. Before that she spent four years at Cosmos Studio on architecture, interiors and BIM, including public service buildings at NEOM.</p>
      <p>Her work covers the full concept stage: the idea, the 3D model, the visuals and animation that win approval, and the drawing packages and material selections that make it buildable.</p>
      <div class="pillars">{pillars.map(([t, d]) => <div><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></div>)}</div>
      <div class="cv">{cv.map(([y, t]) => <div><span>{y}</span><span>{t}</span></div>)}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--white); }
  .wrap { display: grid; gap: 48px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .wrap { grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr; } }
  .eyebrow { color: var(--grey); display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  blockquote { margin: 24px 0 0; font: italic 500 clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px)/1.2 var(--display); color: var(--oxblood); }
  .body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .pillars { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 28px 32px; margin-top: 16px; }
  @media (min-width: 620px) { .pillars { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
  .pillars h3 { font-size: 24px; color: var(--oxblood); }
  .pillars p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--grey); margin-top: 6px; }
  .cv { display: grid; gap: 10px; margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 15px; }
  .cv div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: 16px; }
  .cv span:first-child { color: var(--grey); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
</style>
